{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56926","headline":"宋齐丘引南唐开国谶（题拟） · 佚名","name":"宋齐丘引南唐开国谶（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密密作，唐唐得。\n（《新编分门古今类事》卷二十引《纪异录》）（按：《纪异录》载宋齐丘劝徐知诰即位语云：「又谶曰『密密作』，杨行密开托之初也。\n『唐唐得』，非公而谁？\n天命定矣，愿公速副民望。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}